From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Jerry.Guo" <jerry.guo@mediatek.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Jun 2025 17:16:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: MEDIATEK: pcie: disable SBR on Gen4 Ports

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2114759

Add quirk function to skip pcie secondary bus reset. PCIe gen4 link
will downgrade to gen1 after SBR, so we have to skip this operation.

Signed-off-by: Jerry.Guo <jerry.guo@mediatek.com>
Signed-off-by: Yenchia Chen <yenchia.chen@mediatek.com>
Signed-off-by: Abhishek Sahu <abhsahu@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Noah Wager <noah.wager@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
Signed-off--by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>

(cherry picked from commit 0185574be322 noble:linux-nvidia-6.14)
Signed-off-by: Abdur Rahman <abdur.rahman@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00050
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-6.17@887e729df9e9a394fb51af55d8859b72de21ee8a
---
 drivers/pci/quirks.c    | 5 ++++-
 include/linux/pci_ids.h | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pci/quirks.c b/drivers/pci/quirks.c
index e6348b9d8f6c..0416fcd4fa26 100644
--- a/drivers/pci/quirks.c
+++ b/drivers/pci/quirks.c
@@ -3762,13 +3762,16 @@ static void quirk_no_bus_reset(struct pci_dev *dev)
 }
 
 /*
- * Root ports with Gen5x4 supported on some NVIDIA chip will
+ * Root ports with Gen5x4, Gen4x1 supported on some NVIDIA chip will
  * encounter problems occasionally after SBR (secondary bus
  * reset) is applied. Avoid applying SBR on these root ports.
  */
 DECLARE_PCI_FIXUP_HEADER(PCI_VENDOR_ID_NVIDIA, PCI_DEVICE_ID_NVIDIA_MT8901_GEN5_X4,
 			quirk_no_bus_reset);
 
+DECLARE_PCI_FIXUP_HEADER(PCI_VENDOR_ID_NVIDIA, PCI_DEVICE_ID_NVIDIA_MT8901_GEN4_X1,
+			quirk_no_bus_reset);
+
 /*
  * Some NVIDIA GPU devices do not work with bus reset, SBR needs to be
  * prevented for those affected devices.
diff --git a/include/linux/pci_ids.h b/include/linux/pci_ids.h
index 945c7ae2ec03..92651d39b6e5 100644
--- a/include/linux/pci_ids.h
+++ b/include/linux/pci_ids.h
@@ -1383,7 +1383,7 @@
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_NVIDIA_NFORCE_MCP79_SMBUS     0x0AA2
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_NVIDIA_NFORCE_MCP89_SATA	    0x0D85
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_NVIDIA_MT8901_GEN5_X4         0x22CE
-
+#define PCI_DEVICE_ID_NVIDIA_MT8901_GEN4_X1         0x22D0
 
 #define PCI_VENDOR_ID_IMS		0x10e0
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_IMS_TT128		0x9128
